# Staging output from emit.py. Build artifacts, not source.
#
# emit.py writes here by default rather than into
# math-machine/Levels/LevelData/, because the phased .tres format is not
# readable by the shipped hint system until the CRs in
# HINT_SYSTEM_PHASE_CHANGE_REQUESTS.md land. Pass --in-project once the game
# side is ready.
#
# The checked-in copies live in emitter/golden/ and are what the test corpus
# compares against.
*
!.gitignore
